  "description": "SambaFileManager is a .NET library that simplifies file operations on Samba (SMB) servers.\n      It provides an easy-to-use interface for reading, writing, and deleting files over an SMB network.\n      The library integrates seamlessly with .NET Dependency Injection, making it an ideal choice for enterprise applications\n      that require secure file handling over a Samba server.",
